[b]This mod is a repack. All the engineering credit belongs to other people.[/b]

[b]Community Shaders[/b]
The entire renderer. This package only changes which features are enabled by default and ships a prebuilt shader cache.
https://github.com/community-shaders/skyrim-community-shaders

[b]doodlum[/b]
Community Shaders founder and its most prolific contributor by a wide margin. Effectively every feature this package ships traces back through that work.
https://www.nexusmods.com/skyrimspecialedition/users/1366316

[b]alandtse[/b]
Community Shaders founder, and maintainer of three things this build depends on directly: the CommonLibVR / CommonLibSSE-NG fork it is built against, the DirectX 11 port of the FidelityFX SDK, and hlslkit, the tool used to validate the shaders in this package.
Also the author of [b]Open Shaders[/b], a Community Shaders fork with features this build does not have.
https://www.nexusmods.com/skyrimspecialedition/mods/180419

[b]Every other Community Shaders contributor[/b]
Tim (Tim Butler), Skrubby Skrub In A Shrub, jiayev, davo0411, C. S., Dlizzio, FlayaN, Ilya Perapechka, soda, Pentalimbed, TheRiverwoodModder, ThePagi — and everyone not named here.

[b]CharmedBaryon[/b] — CommonLibSSE-NG, the library that makes a single build work across game runtimes.
[b]SKSE team[/b] — ianpatt, behippo, purple lunchbox, meh321 and contributors. None of this exists without SKSE.

[b]Upscaling[/b]
NVIDIA — Streamline, DLSS and Reflex.
AMD — FidelityFX Super Resolution.

[b]Libraries[/b]
Dear ImGui (ocornut) · Microsoft Detours · DirectXTex · nlohmann/json · magic_enum (Neargye) · bshoshany-thread-pool · EASTL · efsw · pystring · stb · unordered_dense · xbyak · Tracy · CLibUtil · Effects11

[b]Fonts[/b]
Sovngarde and Sanguis (Skyrim-styled fonts, SIL OFL) · IBM Plex (IBM) · Inter (Rasmus Andersson) · Crimson Pro · Jost · Roboto and Roboto Slab · Rubik · OpenDyslexic — all under the SIL Open Font License, licences included in the archive.

[b]Licence[/b]
GPL-3.0, same as Community Shaders. Source for this exact build:
